<title>IRAN: Iran appoints new deputy oil minister - report.</title>
<headline>Iran appoints new deputy oil minister - report.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian Oil Minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh appointed Mehdi Hussaini as his deputy and head of the state-owned National Petrochemical Company, Iran News daily reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He replaces Ahmad Rahgozar.</p>
</text>
